  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup warm water (110 degrees F/45 degrees C)",
    "1 (.25 ounce) package active dry yeast",
    "1 teaspoon white sugar",
    "2.5 cups bread flour",
    "2 tablespoons olive oil",
    "1 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat oven to 450 degrees F (230 degrees C), and lightly grease a pizza pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/PWCpWJ0K5Qs7t1BOWCT5NTP7b8c=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20171-quick-and-easy-pizza-crust-DDMFS-Step-1-cf69484242dd471bad8423280e7c7c65.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20171/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place warm water in a bowl; add yeast and sugar. Mix and let stand until creamy, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HShLCd3jtaqrQ4PdDpM_NiSlkI8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20171-quick-and-easy-pizza-crust-step2-215-4x3-f6ccf044c65647038caf0ee7e1c78664.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20171/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add flour, oil, and salt to the yeast mixture; beat until smooth. You can do this by hand or use a stand mixer fitted with a dough hook to make it easier.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iWlF_PWaHlUKVLFEvTe1FMvedgQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20171-quick-and-easy-pizza-crust-step3-216-4x3-870ed5d74fa74bdc86736041a9e5b439.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20171/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let rest for 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/BmjtrPcL0a-yoN0Z7nS_CSJKwPs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20171-quick-and-easy-pizza-crust-step4-220-4x3-9f6f2fe236754e2e8cc3779fc0f8ad9f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20171/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn dough out onto a lightly floured surface and pat or roll into a 12-inch circle.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4_8MPWf_9JpMCQBiHVhxDfU0OEw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20171-quick-and-easy-pizza-crust-step6-226-4x3-14feb9228539410b8a8eb9ab18fa6288.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20171/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer to the prepared pizza pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OGpyfvmlQWWJ2qQhhaQw7aN03ak=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20171-quick-and-easy-pizza-crust-step7-228-4x3-31bf7c6ba38b46b2af7dba80cc6730fa.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20171/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread crust with sauce and toppings of your choice.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/orge7iyL9scLcZvDDuwFyFZJ10Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/20171-quick-and-easy-pizza-crust-step8-229-4x3-ae83adff9a5c473789941a09b5a88978.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20171/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, 15 to 20 minutes. Remove from the oven and let cool for 5 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1RCV_iJpbztKS2k_y3sscbIAnUc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-20171-quick-and-easy-pizza-crust-VAT-4x3-2-229693959a224d749b062d4eb8983351.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/20171/step_08.webp"
    }
  ],
